    {
      "id": "EVIVpE-1W5n_AVI2iuwQr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2587.8233728591613,
      "y": -1132.3895404430336,
      "width": 418.1915588378906,
      "height": 380,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "4d_Sudp63Tz8uwOaGdiNl",
      "index": "b0r1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 737390284,
      "version": 758,
      "versionNonce": 2103367284,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778727991094,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Periodic Backup\n- Backup of the database will be saved periodically\nto a replacement database. \n\n- We will have to have some tolerance with some data\nbeing lost and a decent amount of time with the\nsystem down. Maybe for admin tools, or internal\ntools.\n\n- Is cheap \n\nDownsides:\n- Increase the amount of downside, we need to\nprovision the new server and load the data into the\nnew DB. Depending on the amount of data, that can\ntake hours - days.\n\n- Any data that happens after the BU creation will\nbe lost.  ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "IkyRjlqnc7Mq0kQLs7q4T",
      "originalText": "Periodic Backup\n- Backup of the database will be saved periodically to a replacement database. \n\n- We will have to have some tolerance with some data being lost and a decent amount of time with the system down. Maybe for admin tools, or internal tools.\n\n- Is cheap \n\nDownsides:\n- Increase the amount of downside, we need to provision the new server and load the data into the new DB. Depending on the amount of data, that can take hours - days.\n\n- Any data that happens after the BU creation will be lost.  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
