    {
      "id": "RmW3VROaRu8V2BjNsbi3P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3897.0412876530813,
      "y": -1053.3570969779482,
      "width": 419.3916015625,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "5T3lOrH1LJbNgYBp5qOTk",
      "index": "b1Qn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 393783372,
      "version": 544,
      "versionNonce": 1928460788,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778722729229,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Most databases will have the replication feature so\nwe turn it on and the database will start saving to\nthe replicate database.  \n\n- We can also manually save the information to the\nreplicated database. \n\n- Replicated DB will be always \"warm\" so it will have\nthe data ready to be used. \n\n- The down window is really short, we just have to\nredirect the traffic to the replicated database if the\nprimary DB is down. \n\n- Very little or non data is lost. \n\nDownsides. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "KsXqBxvZS7L-uyWxEtCLB",
      "originalText": "- Most databases will have the replication feature so we turn it on and the database will start saving to the replicate database.  \n\n- We can also manually save the information to the replicated database. \n\n- Replicated DB will be always \"warm\" so it will have the data ready to be used. \n\n- The down window is really short, we just have to redirect the traffic to the replicated database if the primary DB is down. \n\n- Very little or non data is lost. \n\nDownsides. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
