      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "7YqBX7h7a-wZkTyF8vH_Z",
      "index": "b3ZV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1262995316,
      "version": 521,
      "versionNonce": 103364556,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778723160375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We are writing simultaneusly to both\ndatabases from our web server. \n\n- We are not relying anymore in\nreplication. We will have two primary\ndatabases ready to go live always. \n\n- The problem that needs to be solved\nis the synchronisation between them if\none of them go down and we rely on the\nother, meaning that until recovery we\nwill only be writing to one PDB. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "by88KLEwLLw4rGZaG3L6I",
      "originalText": "- We are writing simultaneusly to both databases from our web server. \n\n- We are not relying anymore in replication. We will have two primary databases ready to go live always. \n\n- The problem that needs to be solved is the synchronisation between them if one of them go down and we rely on the other, meaning that until recovery we will only be writing to one PDB. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
