    {
      "id": "1UsHa0onRnr7KAXzK8B4D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2844.1699381783874,
      "y": -78.43360597010152,
      "width": 449.9835510253906,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "CI4UpK0PFx5OfGSShiPwA"
      ],
      "frameId": "vkYdCFYZ4tZ4MvCAiFID_",
      "index": "b4AV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1671219316,
      "version": 921,
      "versionNonce": 300725236,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778731080022,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How is data divided between shards? \n\n- Normally, we will set up some rules for data to be saved\non each shard (partition) by an specific rule. \n    E.g.\n    - Shard 1 -> UserId > 0 && userId <= 1000\n    - Shard 2 ->  UserId > 1000 && userId <= 2000\n    - Shard 3 -> UserId > 2000 && userId <= 3000\n\n- Each shard will contain the same schema (tables) and\nthe information will be saved based on the rules. \n\n- When doing Shard in serverless like DynamoDB, we will\npick a partition key and AWS will be in charge of the\npartitions based on the key. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "pMn319oxPSZYy-mR0b_Ud",
      "originalText": "How is data divided between shards? \n\n- Normally, we will set up some rules for data to be saved  on each shard (partition) by an specific rule. \n    E.g.\n    - Shard 1 -> UserId > 0 && userId <= 1000\n    - Shard 2 ->  UserId > 1000 && userId <= 2000\n    - Shard 3 -> UserId > 2000 && userId <= 3000\n\n- Each shard will contain the same schema (tables) and the information will be saved based on the rules. \n\n- When doing Shard in serverless like DynamoDB, we will pick a partition key and AWS will be in charge of the partitions based on the key. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1716,
      "versionNonce": 395974004,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "vjI8oVQqaanpLWXJGeih8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2841.7483945158333,
      "y": 259.89564781025405,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "width": 457.84769603955607,
      "height": 210,
      "seed": 570518348,
